If you control the Worker, deploy `script.js` (runtime proxy) to your Workers domain (`ai.nspired.cc`) and remove the custom-proxy UI entirely—calls go straight to the runtime proxy, no optional input needed. If you don’t control Workers, keep the optional input but default to the runtime proxy URL above.